    {
      "title": "Card notes",
      "text": "1. Marks coloured RED shall be rounded / passed to PORT. Those coloured GREEN and underlined shall be rounded/passed to STARBOARD\n2. The finishing line for Round The Cans courses races shall, unless the race is shortened, be in Howth Sound in the area between Spit (S) mark and the South Rowan Buoy (R). Spit mark shall be passed to starboard when approaching the finish. The line itself shall be between a spherical orange buoy and the main mast (or red/white pole) on the adjacent Comm Vess displaying a blue flag.\n3. This course card forms part of the Sailing Instructions."
    }
